Package: wayland-canvas
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Marek Kudlacz <marek@kudlacz.com>
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: quickshell, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, ffmpeg
Description: Infinite-canvas Wayland compositor with virtual desktops
 Windows live anywhere on an unbounded zoomable canvas; virtual desktops are
 screen-sized dashed frames you drag over the windows however you like.
 Windows get Windows-11-style title bars with minimize, maximize/restore and
 close. Ships the session file for display managers and wayland-canvas-session
 to set and restore the default session.
